#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK"
msgid "Yet another ground type."
msgstr "Noch ein weiterer Bodentyp."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR"
msgid "These are floorboards."
msgstr "Das sind Dielen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER"
msgid "Mmmm."
msgstr "Mmmm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS"
msgid "Its shell is so spiky!"
msgstr "Die Schale ist so stachelig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING"
msgid "What a waste of wood."
msgstr "Was für eine Holzverschwendung."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT"
msgid "I feel like I could have prevented that."
msgstr "Ich glaub, ich hätte es verhindern können."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Take that, nature!"
msgstr "Nimm das, Natur!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks sick. More so than usual."
msgstr "Sieht kränker als gewöhnlich aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's all stick-y."
msgstr "Ganz klebrig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "There's a stick-y tree inside it that wants to get out."
msgstr "Da drin steckt ein Baum, der raus will."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "It doesn't need any help to grow."
msgstr "Das wächst von alleine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "That tree looks pretty wimpy."
msgstr "Dieser Baum sieht erbärmlich aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "It's a bunch of small twigs."
msgstr "Das ist ein Bündel kleiner Zweige."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "I always hate when my hair gets wet and poofy."
msgstr "Ich hasse es, wenn meine Haare nass werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "I hope this doesn't make anyone eel!"
msgstr "Hoffentlich wird davon niemandem schlecht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It doesn't look finished! It could be dangerous."
msgstr "Das sieht noch nicht fertig aus. Es könnte gefährlich sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "I'm waffling on whether it needs more syrup."
msgstr "Da gehört vielleicht noch Sirup drauf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "That won't do at all."
msgstr "Das macht nichts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmmmm. I guess that'll have to do."
msgstr "Hmmm. Ich nehme an, dass das getan werden muss."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "This seems like a bad idea."
msgstr "Das scheint mir keine gute Idee zu sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Spacey and smooth!"
msgstr "Glatt und leblos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "Very light, but surprisingly tough."
msgstr "SIEHT WIE EIN SEHR HARTER BAUM AUS."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "An ancient piece of wall."
msgstr "Ein uraltes Stück einer Mauer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "A solid piece of history."
msgstr "Ein solides Stück Geschichte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "That's a nice wall."
msgstr "Das ist eine tolle Mauer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "They make me feel so safe."
msgstr "Sie sorgen dafür, dass ich mich sicher fühle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt!"
msgstr "Verbrannt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Pointy!"
msgstr "Spitz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "Pickets!"
msgstr "Latten!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "Walruses are natural predators."
msgstr "Walrosse sind natürliche Feinde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "It's covered with walrus hairs."
msgstr "Er ist mir Walrosshaaren bedeckt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks like somebody was camping here."
msgstr "Sieht aus, als hätte hier jemand kampiert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks warm and cozy inside."
msgstr "Dort drinnen sieht es warm und behaglich aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "I'm sure I'll find a use for it eventually."
msgstr "Ich bin mir sicher, dass ich einen Nutzen dafür finden werde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "That's burning fast!"
msgstr "Das brennt schnell!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "It's outta style now."
msgstr "Das ist schon eher mein Stil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "It holds dark, forbidden secrets..."
msgstr "Es hält dunkle, verbotene Geheimnisse..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "You might be something to reckon with, big dog."
msgstr "Das ist wohl etwas, mit dem man rechnen muss."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It burned down."
msgstr "Es ist abgebrannt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I need to put a torch in it."
msgstr "Ich muss eine Fackel hineinstecken."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I should make something fun."
msgstr "Ich sollte etwas Spaßiges machen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "I think those bees are mad."
msgstr "Ich glaube, die Bienen sind wütend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "What a scientific marvel!"
msgstr "Welch ein Wunder der Wissenschaft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "Sticky sweet."
msgstr "Klebrig und süß."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "Let the juice run down your face."
msgstr "Damit läuft der Saft dein Gesicht herunter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "Cryogenic watermelon."
msgstr "Kryogenische Wassermelone."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Juicy and warm."
msgstr "Saftig und warm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a melon seed."
msgstr "Das ist ein Samen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "I'd like to avoid a punch from %s, if possible."
msgstr "Ich möchte einen Schlag von %s vermeiden, wenn es geht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s is really heating things up today."
msgstr "%s lässt heute nichts anbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "Nice try. You're not escaping to Valhalla yet, %s."
msgstr "Netter Versuch. Du entkommst noch nicht nach Walhalla, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "%s's gone berserk!"
msgstr "%s ist ausgeflippt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has full command of spirits."
msgstr "%s beherrscht die Geister."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "Pretty fancy hat, that."
msgstr "Ziemlich ausgefallener Hut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Some sheets of wax paper."
msgstr "Ein paar Blätter Wachspapier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "Seems you've gone from \"dapper\" to \"slapper\"."
msgstr "Eben noch ganz vornehm und jetzt der Schlägertyp."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s's just asking to get roasted."
msgstr "%s setzt es darauf an, gebraten zu werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Decent day to you, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "Don't look at me like that, %s! I'm working on it!"
msgstr "Sieh mich nicht so an, %s! Ich arbeite dran!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "I'll show you Logic and Reason... those're my fists!"
msgstr "Dir zeig ich Logik und Verstand... das sind meine Fäuste!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is using his powers for good."
msgstr "%s setzt seine Kräfte für das Gute ein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
msgid "Spooky."
msgstr "Gespenstisch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "I'm gonna roll up a papyrus newspaper, just in case."
msgstr "Ich werde für den Fall der Fälle ein Stück Papyrus-Zeitung zusammenrollen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "We need to have a group meeting about fire safety."
msgstr "Wir müssen eine Gruppenbesprechung über den Brandschutz abhalten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "%s is really buggin' me for a heart."
msgstr "%s will wirklich ein Herz von mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! I'll squash you, %s!"
msgstr "Mörder! Ich werde dich zerquetschen, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is playing well with others."
msgstr "%s spielt gut mit anderen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "Poor little guy. He deserves a proper funeral."
msgstr "Armer kleiner Kerl. Er verdient eine angemessene Bestattung."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "I guess they're fighting for us."
msgstr "Ich schätze, sie kämpfen für uns."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s doesn't have any sharp objects, does she?"
msgstr "%s hat keine scharfen Gegenstände, oder?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I know you set those flames, %s."
msgstr "Ich weiß, dass du das Feuer gemacht hast, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "I'm seeing double! I'd better concoct a heart for %s."
msgstr "Ich sehe doppelt! Ich sollte besser ein Herz für %s zusammenbrauen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer!"
msgstr "Mörder!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s treats ghosts like family."
msgstr "%s behandelt Geister wie Familie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is silent, but deadly..."
msgstr "%s ist ruhig, aber tödlich..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Wait, don't tell me. You lit a fire."
msgstr "Warte, sag's nicht. Du hast ein Feuer angezündet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "How do you say \"I'll concoct a revival device\" in mime?"
msgstr "Wie sagt man in Zeichensprache \"Ich werde ein Wiederbelebungsgerät zusammenbauen\"?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "Mime this!"
msgstr "Nimm das!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "%s thinks outside the invisible box."
msgstr "%s schaut auch mal über den Tellerrand hinaus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "It tastes like nothing."
msgstr "Ihhh! Schmeckt nach Abfall."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "I hope it dries off soon."
msgstr "Ich hoffe, das trocknet bald."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "This package is barely holding together."
msgstr "Dieses Paket hält kaum noch zusammen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "Nothing like loud noises to help keep the peace."
msgstr "Ein lauter Knall hält alle in Schach."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "I think %s's planning to throw the book at me."
msgstr "Ich glaube, %s plant, das Buch nach mir zu werfen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I'm sure you had a very clever reason for that fire."
msgstr "Ich bin sicher, dass es für das Feuer einen guten Grund gab."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "This doesn't seem very scientific, does it, %s?"
msgstr "Dies wirkt nicht sehr wissenschaftlich, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Here comes my peer review!"
msgstr "Hier kommt mein Peer-Review!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "I have deep respect for %s's practical theorems."
msgstr "Ich habe großen Respekt für die praktischen Theoreme von %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is holding that lighter pretty tightly..."
msgstr "%s hält das Feuerzeug ziemlich fest..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Again?"
msgstr "Schon wieder?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day to you, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "I bet you're just burning for a heart, %s."
msgstr "Ich wette, du bist ganz scharf auf ein Herz, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Arsonist!"
msgstr "Mörder! Brandstifter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, friend of ghosts."
msgstr "%s, Freund von Geistern."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "Yeesh. Do I always look that creepy?"
msgstr "Jawoll. Seh ich immer so gruselig aus?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Burning that wasn't very scientific, %s."
msgstr "Das zu verbrennen, war nicht sehr wissenschaftlich, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Stars and atoms! Are you my doppelganger?"
msgstr "Sterne und Atome! Bist du etwa mein Doppelgänger?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "Best concoct a revival device. Can't leave another man of science floating."
msgstr "Ich stelle besser mein Wiederbelebungsgerät zusammen. Kann doch keinen Wissenschaftlerkollegen hängen lassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Your existence is an affront to the laws of science, %s!"
msgstr "Deine Existenz ist ein Affront gegen die Gesetze der Wissenschaft, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has expertly put our theories into practice."
msgstr "%s hat unsere Theorien fachmännisch in die Praxis umgesetzt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is a safety hazard."
msgstr "%s ist ein Sicherheitsrisiko."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Things are burning up at the factory."
msgstr "In der Fabrik sind die Dinge heute am Anbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day to you, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "Looks like someone threw a wrench into your plans."
msgstr "Dir hat wohl jemand einen Strich durch die Pläne gemacht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "It ends here, %s!"
msgstr "Hier ist Schluss, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "You're pretty handy to have around, %s."
msgstr "Wie praktisch, dass du da bist, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire!"
msgstr "Es brennt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "Science couldn't save it."
msgstr "Die Wissenschaft konnte es nicht retten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey! That's not science!"
msgstr "Hey! Das ist keine Wissenschaft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "It'll turn off soon."
msgstr "Das wird sich bald abschalten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF"
msgid "Science beats magic, every time."
msgstr "Wissenschaft schlägt Magie. Immer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire!"
msgstr "Es brennt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT"
msgid "Science couldn't save it."
msgstr "Die Wissenschaft konnte es nicht retten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks science-y. How does it work?"
msgstr "Sieht nach Wissenschaft aus. Wie funktioniert es?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER"
msgid "It's getting low on power."
msgstr "Es geht langsam aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF"
msgid "I could get it working, if Winona's busy."
msgstr "Ich könnte es zum Laufen bringen, wenn Winona zu tun hat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire!"
msgstr "Es brennt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT"
msgid "Science couldn't save it."
msgstr "Die Wissenschaft konnte es nicht retten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC"
msgid "She's made a sort of automatic defense system."
msgstr "Sie hat eine Art automatisches Verteidigungssystem geschaffen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF"
msgid "It needs some electricity."
msgstr "Es braucht etwas Strom."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire!"
msgstr "Es brennt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Science couldn't save it."
msgstr "Die Wissenschaft konnte es nicht retten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "What an ingenious idea!"
msgstr "Was für eine geniale Idee!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF"
msgid "It needs some electricity."
msgstr "Es braucht etwas Strom."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "It'll be good for when winter comes."
msgstr "Der wird nützlich sein, wenn der Winter kommt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Its measuring days are over."
msgstr "Die Tage der Messungen sind vorbei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Mercurial."
msgstr "Launenhaft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "The anatomy's not right, but I'll overlook it."
msgstr "Die Anatomie passt nicht, aber darüber werde ich hinwegsehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "I'm going to eat forty. For science."
msgstr "Davon werde ich vierzig essen. Für die Wissenschaft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "A Yuletide toothache waiting to happen."
msgstr "Da wartet ein festlicher Zahnschmerz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "That experiment may have been a tiny bit unethical."
msgstr "Kann sein, dass das Experiment nicht ganz ethisch vertretbar ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "It's nice to eat something other than berries for once."
msgstr "Schön, mal was anderes als immer nur Beeren zu essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "I'm puddin' that straight in my mouth!"
msgstr "Das gehört in meinen Mund!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "It's a hollowed apple filled with yummy juice."
msgstr "Ein ausgehöhlter Apfel mit leckerem Saft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "How does it stay warm? A thermodynamical mug?"
msgstr "Wie bleibt das warm? Thermodynamische Tasse?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "Can science explain why it tastes so good?"
msgstr "Ob sich dieser leckere Geschmack wissenschaftlich erklären lässt?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Every scientist appreciates a good bauble."
msgstr "Jeder Wissenschaftler schätzt eine gute Kugel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "This one is especially impressive."
msgstr "Die hier ist besonders eindrucksvoll."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "I should hang this one over a fire."
msgstr "Das sollte ich über ein Feuer hängen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "For some reason it makes me hungry."
msgstr "Aus irgendeinem Grund macht es mich hungrig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "A tree's not complete without some electricity."
msgstr "Erst mit Elektrizität wird ein Baum perfekt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "That was a mistake, I think."
msgstr "Das war wohl ein Fehler."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "That puts a damper on the festivities."
msgstr "Das trübt das Fest jetzt ein bisschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "Happy Winter's Feast!"
msgstr "Fröhliches Winterfest!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It's almost Winter's Feast!"
msgstr "Bald ist Winterfest!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "That puts a damper on the festivities."
msgstr "Das trübt das Fest jetzt ein bisschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "I need a pine cone for that."
msgstr "Ich brauche einen Tannenzapfen dafür."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "Let's not start a fight with the strongman..."
msgstr "Lass uns keinen Kampf mit dem Starken anfangen..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You can't actually \"fight\" fire, %s!"
msgstr "Man kann Feuer tatsächlich \"bekämpfen\", %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's good to see you, %s!"
msgstr "Schön, dich zu sehen, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "I told you you couldn't deadlift that boulder. The numbers were all wrong."
msgstr "Hab ich doch gesagt, dass du diesen Felsbrocken nicht hochheben kannst. Die Voraussetzungen waren nicht gegeben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! I can take you!"
msgstr "Mörder! Ich mach dich fertig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is just a big teddy bear."
msgstr "%s ist nur ein großer Teddybär."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been a bit of a sap lately..."
msgstr "%s war in letzter Zeit ein bisschen ein Trottel..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "%s's gone on a wood chucking rampage!"
msgstr "%s ist auf einem hölzernen Amoklauf!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "Will you bea-very mad if I don't revive you, %s?"
msgstr "Bist du sehr wütend, wenn ich dich nicht wiederbelebe, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't burn yourself out, %s."
msgstr "Verbrenn dich nicht selbst, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "Seid gegrüßt, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "Does \"universal\" coverage include the void, %s?"
msgstr "Gilt lückenlose Abdeckung auch dort, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Murder! Bring me an axe and we'll get in the swing of things!"
msgstr "Mord! Bring mir eine Axt, und wir werden mitmischen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s saved everyone's backbacon."
msgstr "%s hat alle gerettet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Just looks like a pile of dirt."
msgstr "Sieht aus wie ein Haufen Dreck."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "Seems safe to me."
msgstr "Scheint sicher zu sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "It's a worm!"
msgstr "Ein Wurm!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Soft and undulating."
msgstr "Weich und hügelig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "Science compels me to jump in."
msgstr "Die Wissenschaft zwingt mich, dort hineinzuspringen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "Guh, that thing looks worse off than usual."
msgstr "Uh, das Ding sieht schlechter als gewohnt aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "Looks delicious."
msgstr "Sieht lecker aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "Kinda wrinkled."
msgstr "Irgendwie rau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "Seems safe to me."
msgstr "Scheint sicher zu sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "I knew %s couldn't be trusted!"
msgstr "Ich wusste, dass man %s nicht vertrauen kann!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s is becoming a survival liability."
msgstr "%s wird zum Überlebensrisiko."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings to you, %s!"
msgstr "Sei gegrüßt, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "I reject the reality of ghosts and imps."
msgstr "Ich lehne die Realität der Geister und Kobolde ab."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Time to grab the imp by the horns!"
msgstr "Zeit, den Kobold bei den Hörnern zu packen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks for lending a helping claw, %s."
msgstr "Danke für die Hilfe, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "I think we need to tweak your primary directive, %s..."
msgstr "Ich glaube, wir müssen ein paar Regeln ändern, %s..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You look like you're gonna melt, %s. What happened?"
msgstr "Du siehst aus als würdest du gleich schmelzen, %s. Was ist passiert?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day to you, %s!"
msgstr "Guten Tag, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "I always thought %s could use a heart. Now I'm certain!"
msgstr "Ich dachte immer, %s könnte ein Herz gebrauchen. Jetzt bin ich sicher!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "%s! You've violated the first law!"
msgstr "%s! Du hast gegen die erste Regel verstoßen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "I guess %s got that empathy module up and running."
msgstr "Ich denke, %s hat das Mitgefühlsmodul inzwischen zum Laufen gebracht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "Warm to the touch."
msgstr "Handwarm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "This gem is yellow."
msgstr "Dieser Edelstein ist gelb."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "That ought to show everyone the way."
msgstr "Damit sollte jeder den Weg finden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "A genius invention... a gem on a stick."
msgstr "Eine geniale Erfindung... Edelstein am Stil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "A feast fit for me."
msgstr "Ein wahrer Festschmaus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "A meal only a beast would love."
msgstr "Eine Mahlzeit, die nur eine Bestie mag."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Nothing fancy."
msgstr "Nichts Besonderes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "It's a... thing."
msgstr "Das ist ein... Ding."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "That thing is about to catch fire."
msgstr "Das wird bald Feuer fangen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "It's too dark to see!"
msgstr "Es ist zu dunkel, um was zu sehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Mmm. Beaky."
msgstr "Mh, schnabelig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "I have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "Ich habe ein schlechtes Gefühl bei dieser Sache."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "I left it on too long."
msgstr "Das war wohl zu lange."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Those ingredients didn't make anything."
msgstr "Diese Zutaten haben nichts ergeben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "Time to go!"
msgstr "Zeit zu gehen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "Thou shalt not keep me out!"
msgstr "Du wirst mich nicht raushalten!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "Alas, I am too stricken."
msgstr "Leider bin ich auch am Ende."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I can only command one beastie!"
msgstr "Ich kann nur ein Viech befehligen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I must first dismount from my mighty steed."
msgstr "Ich muss erst von meinem mächtigen Ross absteigen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "Gasp! My furs!"
msgstr "Brrr! Wo sind meine Felle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "That's where I keep all my favorite furs and pelts."
msgstr "Da hab ich meine Lieblingspelze drin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "I shall let them select their garments first."
msgstr "Ich werde sie erst ihre Kleider auswählen lassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "It requireth materials."
msgstr "Es wird Material benötigt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "'Tis in use, and not by me."
msgstr "Das wird verwendet, aber nicht von mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "Alas! 'Tis the wrong plans."
msgstr "Leider sind das die falschen Pläne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "Alas! It doth not go there!"
msgstr "Leider passt das hier nicht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Alas! Bested by cookware!"
msgstr "Von der Sonne übertroffen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "I shall wait whilst my allies plan their feast."
msgstr "Ich werde warten, während meine Verbündeten ihr Fest planen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I must close the gap between us!"
msgstr "Ich muss zusehen, dass die Lücke zwischen uns kleiner wird."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "The muses will not visit me if I do not place an item first."
msgstr "Die Musen werden mich nicht besuchen, wenn ich nicht zuerst etwas platziere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "The girl's spirit cannot be returned."
msgstr "Ihr Geist kann nicht zurückgeholt werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "I'll try once more when it's done."
msgstr "Ich werde es nochmal versuchen, wenn es fertig ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "T'will not raise from death, it seems."
msgstr "Ich glaube, das steht nicht von den Toten auf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "They'll have better things in Valhalla."
msgstr "In Walhalla wird es bessere Sachen geben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We have already conquered this knowledge."
msgstr "Dieses Wissen haben wir bereits erobert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "One sacrifice at a time!"
msgstr "Ein Opfer nach dem anderen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "T'will not work."
msgstr "Das klappt nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "The spirit cannot be returned."
msgstr "Der Geist kann nicht zurückgeholt werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "The sprite home requires sprucing up. With magical spruce!"
msgstr "Ds muss etwas herausgeputzt werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "Forest sprites have no need of that."
msgstr "Waldfichten brauchen sowas nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "Needs the gaze of Mani to work."
msgstr "Funktioniert nur, wenn Mani zusieht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That's not worthy to grace the mouth of the gods!"
msgstr "Das ist es nicht wert, den Mund der Götter zu zieren!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "This object is not blessed with the power of the gods."
msgstr "Dieses Objekt ist nicht mit der Kraft der Götter gesegnet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "That material is not befitting a work of art."
msgstr "Dieses Material ist einem Kunstwerk nicht standesgemäß."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "The gods may frown were I to do that."
msgstr "Mich schauen die Götter krumm an, wenn ich das mache."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "Danger is near! 'tis no time for games."
msgstr "Gefahr in Verzug! Das ist keine Zeit für Spiele."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "I must clear the battlefield first!"
msgstr "Ich muss zuerst das Schlachtfeld aufräumen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "'tis too late for revelry!"
msgstr "Es ist zu spät zum Feiern!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Such sweet slumber... Maybe later."
msgstr "So schöner Schlaf. Vielleicht später"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "One material at a time!"
msgstr "Ein Material nach dem anderen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "This gem was not chosen for this purpose."
msgstr "Dieser Edelstein wurde nicht zu diesem Zweck ausgewählt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "We must rearrange the bones of the beast."
msgstr "Wir müssen die Knochen der Bestie wieder zusammensetzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I'll try once more when they're free."
msgstr "Ich versuch es nochmal, wenn sie frei sind."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "They'll have better things in Valhalla."
msgstr "In Walhalla wird es bessere Sachen geben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "They're not strong enough to carry more!"
msgstr "Sie sind nicht stark genug, um mehr zu tragen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Such sweet slumber graces thy face... Maybe later."
msgstr "Solch süßer Schlummer ziert dein Gesicht... Vielleicht später."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I'll try once more when they're free."
msgstr "Ich versuch es nochmal, wenn sie frei sind."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "They'll have better things in Valhalla."
msgstr "In Walhalla wird es bessere Sachen geben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "They're not strong enough to carry more!"
msgstr "Sie sind nicht stark genug, um mehr zu tragen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Such sweet slumber graces thy face... Maybe later."
msgstr "Solch süßer Schlummer ziert dein Gesicht... Vielleicht später."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE"
msgid "I'll need to be faster than that in battle!"
msgstr "Im Kampf muss ich schneller sein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "I'll only ride it if it's the victor."
msgstr "Ich werde es reiten, wenn es gewinnt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE"
msgid "Someone hath beat me to it!"
msgstr "Jemand ist mir zuvorgekommen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION"
msgid "There is no glory in that weapon!"
msgstr "In dieser Waffe steckt nichts Ruhmvolles!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE"
msgid "It will not stay in place!"
msgstr "Das bleibt da nicht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH"
msgid "This food doth need a different dish."
msgstr "Für das Essen braucht man einen anderen Teller."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH"
msgid "I hath used a dish already."
msgstr "Das hab ich schon verwendet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "That is not a job for a warrior!"
msgstr "Das ist keine Aufgabe für einen Krieger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE"
msgid "True warriors wait their turn."
msgstr "Echte Krieger warten bis sie dran sind."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "I'll only ride it if it's the victor."
msgstr "Ich werde es reiten, wenn es gewinnt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO"
msgid "Let him sleep. Then I'll prune him."
msgstr "Lass ihn schlafen. Dann werde ich ihn stutzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Unshaveworthy."
msgstr "Nicht rasierenswert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS"
msgid "But there's nothing to trim!"
msgstr "Aber es gibt nichts zu trimmen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is already brimming with goods."
msgstr "Sie voll bis zum Rand."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE"
msgid "My stalwart companion currently has use of that."
msgstr "Mein treuer Begleiter hat derzeit Gebrauch davon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "I fear that does not go there."
msgstr "Fürchtet sie Feuer? Sie sollte es."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN"
msgid "That knowledge is forbidden by the gods."
msgstr "Nektar der Götter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN"
msgid "I already wield such knowledge."
msgstr "Das kann ich nicht ausüben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD"
msgid "This map is for some distant land..."
msgstr "Diese Karte ist für irgendein fernes Land..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS"
msgid "Not when there is battle to be won!"
msgstr "Nicht, wenn es eine Schlacht zu gewinnen gilt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY"
msgid "By Odin's beard, I shall find the right key!"
msgstr "Bei Odins Bart! Ich werde den richtigen Schlüssel finden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY"
msgid "The true key must be out there somewhere."
msgstr "Der wahre Schlüssel muss irgendwo da draußen sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I cannot wrap that which does not exist!"
msgstr "Was es nicht gibt, kann ich nicht einwickeln!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC"
msgid "I fear I cannot!"
msgstr "Ich hab keine Angst!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE"
msgid "I shall valiantly wait my turn."
msgstr "Ich warte, bis ich dran bin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC"
msgid "If I can't do it, it can't be done!"
msgstr "Wenn ich es nicht kann, kann es keiner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT"
msgid "May I return to battle now?"
msgstr "Darf ich jetzt in den Kampf zurückkehren?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE"
msgid "Victory! Alright, let us away."
msgstr "Sieg! Lasst uns durch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL"
msgid "Back to the Otherworld, victory shall be mine!"
msgstr "Zurück ins Jenseits. Der Sieg wird mein sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1"
msgid "The earth rebels against us!"
msgstr "Die Erde rebelliert gegen uns!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2"
msgid "Tis the footsteps of a giant!"
msgstr "Das sind die Fußstapfer eines Riesen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3"
msgid "What plagues you, mother Gaia?"
msgstr "Was plagt euch, Mutter Gaia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1"
msgid "A gift, that you may not devour us."
msgstr "Ein Geschenk, damit ihr uns nicht verschlingt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2"
msgid "A tribute for thee, great lion!"
msgstr "Ein Tribut für dich, großer Löwe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3"
msgid "O great lion, we pay tribute this day!"
msgstr "Oh großer Löwe, wir preisen dich heute!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "The beasts shalt soon reemerge!"
msgstr "Die Bestien werden bald wieder kommen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "The gods are angered!"
msgstr "Die Götter sind verärgert!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3"
msgid "There is danger on the wind!"
msgstr "Es liegt Gefahr in der Luft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST"
msgid "oOooOOOo!!"
msgstr "oOooOooo!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BEES"
msgid "Back, wee speared creatures!"
msgstr "Zurück, ihr stechenden Kreaturen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG"
msgid "Urg! I must master the curved weapon."
msgstr "Urg! Ich muss diese gebogene Waffe beherrschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION"
msgid "Fear! I hath bested you!"
msgstr "Angst, ich habe dich besiegt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_BURNT"
msgid "By Hel's fire!"
msgstr "Zum Höllenfeuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX"
msgid "\nI can repair this."
msgstr "\nIch kann das reparieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN"
msgid "Rocks shall rain from on high!"
msgstr "Steine werden niederregnen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE"
msgid "Show yourself!"
msgstr "Zeig dich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK"
msgid "Coward!"
msgstr "Feigling!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_COLD"
msgid "Brrr! Where are my furs!"
msgstr "Brrr! Wo sind meine Felle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "I fear I'm going to lose my way!"
msgstr "Ich fürchte, ich werde mich verlaufen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "I lack the provisions."
msgstr "Es mangelt an Voraussetzungen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "Slick for battle."
msgstr "Öl für den Kampf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "A worthy foe approaches."
msgstr "Ein angemessener Feind nähert sich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "'Tis the lights of Valhalla?"
msgstr "Sind das die Lichter von Walhalla?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Be banished, beastly blight!"
msgstr "Hinweg du tierisches Übel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "The sun is setting, darkness waits nearby."
msgstr "Die Sonne geht unter. Die Dunkelheit wartet in der Nähe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Meat makes my heart sing!"
msgstr "Fleisch bringt mein Herz zum singen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "This is not food befitting a warrior."
msgstr "Das ist keine Nahnung, die für einen Krieger geeignet ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "Ohh, I don't feel well."
msgstr "Ohh, ich fühle mich nicht gut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "Ugh, fresh is better."
msgstr "Igitt, frisch ist besser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "That was stale beast."
msgstr "Das war verdorben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "This food is not befitting a warrior."
msgstr "Das ist keine Nahnung, die für einen Krieger geeignet ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "Hff... Nothing can weigh a warrior down!"
msgstr "Hmpf... Einem Krieger ist nichts zu schwer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "Huff... Huff..."
msgstr "Uff... Uff..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "Tis... nothing..."
msgstr "Das... ist... doch... gar nichts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "Heave... ho...!"
msgstr "Hauruck!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "Gnnngh..."
msgstr "Ächz..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "Swift... as Sleipnir..."
msgstr "Flink... wie Sleipnir..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "Strong... like Thor..."
msgstr "Stark... wie Thor..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "Enduring... like Freya..."
msgstr "Ausdauernd... wie Freya..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "And the curtain falls."
msgstr "Und der Vorhang fällt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "I step into the light!"
msgstr "Ich trete ins Licht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "I've lost another fan!"
msgstr "Ich habe die Spuren verloren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM"
msgid "Freedom! The saga continues!"
msgstr "Freiheit! Die Saga geht weiter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "They're driving me mad...!"
msgstr "Die treiben mich in den Wahnsinn...!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "I am an excellent craftswoman."
msgstr "Ich bin eine ausgezeichnete Handwerkerin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "The hot sun tires me."
msgstr "Die heiße Sonne ermüdet mich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "The beasts are approaching..."
msgstr "Die Bestien nähern sich..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "How I long for a feast!"
msgstr "Wie sehr ich mich nach einem Festmahl sehne!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "Hush... The creature is near."
msgstr "Still! Die Kreatur ist nah."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "I've lost the tracks."
msgstr "Ich habe die Spuren verloren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "It's too muddy for trailing."
msgstr "Es ist zu matschig, um der Spur zu folgen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER"
msgid "More droppings for you?"
msgstr "Mehr Kot für dich?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL"
msgid "I'm carrying all I can!"
msgstr "Ich trage schon soviel wie ich kann!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP"
msgid "Call thy hordes, they shan't protect thee!"
msgstr "Rufe deine Horden, sie werden dich nicht schützen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE"
msgid "RUN AWAY!"
msgstr "LAUF WEG!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "Now the true battle begins!"
msgstr "Nun beginnt die eigentliche Schlacht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "Ugh, my head."
msgstr "Au, mein Kopf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LEAVE_MINIGAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LEAVE_MINIGAME"
msgid "These weapons belong on the battlefield."
msgstr "Diese Waffen gehören aufs Schlachtfeld."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "I rode in on a bolt lightning."
msgstr "Ich bin auf einem Blitz geritten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "That wasn't very exciting."
msgstr "Das war nicht sehr aufregend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS"
msgid "Away, tiny demons!"
msgstr "Hinfort, ihr winzigen Dämonen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "Don't give up, beast! Fight!"
msgstr "Gib nicht auf, Tier! Kämpfe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK"
msgid "Only a coward would leave now!"
msgstr "Nur ein Feigling würde jetzt abhauen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT"
msgid "Not with the gift of battle before me!"
msgstr "Nicht mit dem Geschenk der Schlacht vor den Augen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA"
msgid "Battle is upon us, there'll be no rest!"
msgstr "Der Kampf ist bei uns. Es wird keine Pause geben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP"
msgid "It's not safe to sleep. Use the spear!"
msgstr "Es ist nicht sicher genug, um zu schlafen. Benutze einen Speer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
msgid "The sun is high, journey on!"
msgstr "Die Sonne steht hoch. Die Reise geht weiter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
msgid "I'll not rest yet."
msgstr "Ich werde noch nicht ruhen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA"
msgid "I'd like a meat snack first."
msgstr "Ich hätte gern erst einen Snack aus Fleisch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
msgid "I'll starve overnight! Feast first."
msgstr "Ich würde über Nacht verhungern! Ich muss erst essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "I must dismount my mighty steed!"
msgstr "Ich muss von meinem mächtigen Ross absteigen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "No napping in the moonlight."
msgstr "Kein Nickerchen im Mondschein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "This doesn't feel like the time for a nap."
msgstr "Es fühlt sich nicht so an, als wäre Zeit für ein Nickerchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "I'll not sleep in the flames."
msgstr "Ich werde nicht in den Flammen schlafen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "I fear I cannot. It is being razed."
msgstr "Ich fürchte, ich kann es nicht. Es wird dem Erdboden gleichgemacht werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "Thankfully, I am light of foot."
msgstr "Glücklicherweise bin ich leichtfüssig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "Away, feisty beaker!"
msgstr "Hinfort, streitsüchtiges Insekt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "I sense Loki's mischievous hand in the shadows."
msgstr "Ich spüre Lokis schelmische Hand in den Schatten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Foul!"
msgstr "Verdorben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "The world shudders!"
msgstr "Die Welt zittert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "Foul magics block mine blows!"
msgstr "Elende Magie blockiert meine Schläge!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "The power of knowledge is great."
msgstr "Wissen ist Macht. Und Macht ist... nun, Macht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "I am restored!"
msgstr "Ich bin wiederhergestellt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "To battle!"
msgstr "Auf in den Kampf!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "Rise, my ally!"
msgstr "Erhebt euch, mein Verbündeter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "I will fight my way out!"
msgstr "Ich werde mich da herauskämpfen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "Alas! I am unworthy!"
msgstr "Leider! Ich bin unwürdig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "I have gained the gods' favor!"
msgstr "Ich habe mir die Gnade der Götter verdient!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Aha! Shelter!"
msgstr "Aha! Unterkunft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "No cage can hold me!"
msgstr "Kein Käfig kann mich halten!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "I'm nearly drowned!"
msgstr "Ich bin fast ersoffen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Doth mine eyes deceive me?"
msgstr "Täuschen mich meine Äuglein?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Arg, I've been poked!"
msgstr "Arg, ich wurde gestochen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "Alas, it is no more."
msgstr "Das war einmal. Leider."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "The beast returned from whence it came."
msgstr "Das Tier ist zurückgekehrt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "Don't let the beast entertain thoughts of escape."
msgstr "Sieh zu, dass das Vieh nicht an Flucht denkt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "Slippery devil!"
msgstr "Rutschiger Teufel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "My light is quenched!"
msgstr "Mein Licht ist erlöschen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Fear not! I have arrived!"
msgstr "Keine Angst! Ich bin da!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "That wasn't part of the plan."
msgstr "Das war nicht Teil des Plans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It is not of this world."
msgstr "Nicht von dieser Welt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WET"
msgid "I am a wet warrior."
msgstr "Ich bin ein nasser Krieger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WETTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WETTER"
msgid "Does this count as a bath?"
msgstr "Zählt das als ein Bad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE"
msgid "That was a sloppy adventure."
msgstr "Das war ein schmutziges Abenteuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WORMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_WORMS"
msgid "The earth quakes with the approach of a foe!"
msgstr "Die Erde bebt unter dem Ansturm eines Feindes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.DEER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.DEER"
msgid "I shall send you to the unicorn!"
msgstr "Ich werde dir das Einhorn schicken!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.GENERIC"
msgid "Valhalla awaits!"
msgstr "Walhalla wartet!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "I'm having pig tonight!"
msgstr "Ich werde heute Schwein zu Abendbrot haben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.PREY"
msgid "Die bravely, little foe!"
msgstr "Stirb, kleiner tapferer Feind!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.SPIDER"
msgid "Spider, meet my spear!"
msgstr "Spinne, spüre meinen Speer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Prepare to be slain!"
msgstr "Bereite dich auf deinen Tod vor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.1"
msgid "Blessings of Tyr!"
msgstr "Der Segen von Tyr!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.2"
msgid "Gods guide my blade!"
msgstr "Götter führen meine Klinge!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.BATTLECRY_BLOODLUST.3"
msgid "To victory!"
msgstr "Zum Sieg!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Odin will have you yet!"
msgstr "Odin wird dich noch kriegen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG"
msgid "I'll be back, pigskin!"
msgstr "Ich werde zurückkommen, Schweinehaut!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY"
msgid "I let you go this time!"
msgstr "Diesmal lasse ich dich noch gehen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER"
msgid "Leggy coward."
msgstr "Langbeiniger Feigling."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Flee, monster! I will return."
msgstr "Verschwinde Monster! Ich werde zurückkehren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL"
msgid "What do you desire, apparition?"
msgstr "Was willst du, Erscheinung?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "For me?"
msgstr "Für mich?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "What is it waiting for?!"
msgstr "Worauf wartet er?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "Perhaps it's best we part ways..."
msgstr "Vielleicht ist es am besten, wir gehen getrennte Wege..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "For me?"
msgstr "Für mich?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "What is it doing?"
msgstr "Was geschieht?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "Something wicked this way comes."
msgstr "Da kommt etwas boshaftes durch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "My victories shall be remembered!"
msgstr "An meine Siege soll sich erinnert werden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "There's a tree hiding within."
msgstr "Darin versteckt sich ein Baum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "The young tree has been cooked."
msgstr "Der junge Baum wurde gekocht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "Grow strong, young twigs!"
msgstr "Werdet stark, ihr jungen Zweige!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "Adventure is calling."
msgstr "Das Abenteuer ruft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "It's red, and a fighter. Just like me!"
msgstr "Es ist rot und ein Kämpfer. So wie ich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "These crafts had better be good."
msgstr "Dieses Handwerk sollte besser gutartig sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "This one is not in working order."
msgstr "Der ist nicht funktionsfähig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "Treasure with a mysterious aura."
msgstr "Schatz mit mysteriöser Aura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "Oh! I love a good hunt."
msgstr "Oh! Ich liebe eine gute Jagd."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "Tis the mighty lion!"
msgstr "Der mächtige Löwe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "We've incurred its wrath!"
msgstr "Wir haben seinen Zorn geweckt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "The lion smiles upon us."
msgstr "Der Löwe lächelt uns an."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "A fitting tribute!"
msgstr "Ein passendes Tribut!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "Excellent armor for the heat of battle."
msgstr "Ausgezeichnete Rüstung für die Hitze des Gefechts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "Grass protection. That's not going to last long."
msgstr "Grasschutz. Der wird nicht lang halten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "Near impenetrable!"
msgstr "Nahezu undurchdringlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "Armor fit for Odin himself!"
msgstr "Rüstung, die selbst für Odin geeignet wäre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "What devilish armor!"
msgstr "Welche teuflische Rüstung!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "She ebbs the ache of hunger. Good fur."
msgstr "Er beseitigt meinen Hunger. Guter Pelz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "A shield of sorts."
msgstr "Eine Art Schutzschild."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "A borrowed tree vest."
msgstr "Eine geliehene Baumweste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "Strong, but such a headache it gives..."
msgstr "Stark, aber macht mir Kopfschmerzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "Signs of a battle past."
msgstr "Zeichen vergangener Kämpfe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "A most well placed sign."
msgstr "Ein gut platziertes Schild."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I shall point the way to triumph!"
msgstr "Ich werde den Weg zum Triumph weisen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Signs of a battle past."
msgstr "Zeichen vergangener Kämpfe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "A most well placed sign."
msgstr "Ein gut platziertes Schild."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I shall point the way to triumph!"
msgstr "Ich werde den Weg zum Triumph weisen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "The flames' remains."
msgstr "Die Überreste der Flammen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "The eyebone could not pass to this world."
msgstr "Der Augenknochen konnte diese Welt nicht verlassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "The flower must remain in its home world."
msgstr "Die Blume muss in ihrer Heimatwelt bleiben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "It's burnt. Gone."
msgstr "Es ist verbrannt. Verloren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "Soon it will open the path!"
msgstr "Bald wird sich der Pfad öffnen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It shan't work again for some time."
msgstr "Das wird jetzt eine Weile nicht wieder funktionieren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "Trickery! The Bifrost was of Loki!"
msgstr "So eine List! Der Bifrost war von Loki!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "Tis the Bifrost!"
msgstr "Es ist der Bifrost!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "A light to guide the way!"
msgstr "Ein Licht, um den Weg zu weisen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "Heimdallr's key to the Bifrost."
msgstr "Heimdallrs Schlüssel zum Bifrost."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "An ancient basin to house flames."
msgstr "Eine antike Schale für Flammen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "An unholy flame."
msgstr "Eine unheilige Flamme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "The writings of the gods t'were not meant for us."
msgstr "Was die Götter schrieben, war nicht an uns gerichtet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "Tis a portrait of an ancient people. They live in wretchedness."
msgstr "Ein Portrait eines alten Volkes. Sie führen ein armseliges Leben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "There is no painting here. Only stone."
msgstr "Hier ist kein Gemälde. Nur Stein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "A great evil sweeps across the land."
msgstr "Ein böses Übel kommt über das Land."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "Many of the people are cleaved in two!"
msgstr "Viele der Menschen sind in zwei Stücke zerteilt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "A glittering city, blessed by the gods."
msgstr "Ein glitzernde Stadt mit dem Segen der Götter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "I doth smell their fear!"
msgstr "Ich kann ihre Angst riechen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "To chop and destroy!"
msgstr "Zum Hacken und Zerstören!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Mini beastie."
msgstr "Minibestie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "The mini beast slumbers."
msgstr "Das Minitier schlummert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "A portable armory."
msgstr "Eine tragbare Waffenkammer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "Pig and eggs!"
msgstr "Schwein und Eier!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "Fie! Foul beast!"
msgstr "Elende Bestie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "Such colors! I could sing!"
msgstr "Was für Farben! Ich könnte singen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "To heal even the deepest of battle wounds."
msgstr "Zum Heilen selbst der tiefsten Kampfwunden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "A thousand mortals couldn't break through this stone."
msgstr "Eintausend Menschen konnten diesen Stein nicht zerbrechen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "Dark winged meat."
msgstr "Dunkles, geflügeltes Fleisch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "Winged spear!"
msgstr "Geflügelter Speer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "They're hiding under the stage."
msgstr "Sie verstecken sich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "Like the wings of my helm, only meatier."
msgstr "Wie die Flügel an meinem Helms, nur fleischiger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked dark wing."
msgstr "Gekochter Nachtflügel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "Fur of the crazies."
msgstr "Pelz der Verrückten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "Beast or berserker?"
msgstr "Bestie oder Berserker?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "BEAR-SERKER!"
msgstr "BÄR-SERKER!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "It fought bravely, but its hide is now forfeit."
msgstr "Er kämpfte tapfer, aber sein Fell gehört nun mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "A luxury fur bed!"
msgstr "Ein luxuriöses Fellbett."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "A tool for valiant naps."
msgstr "Ein Hilfsmittel für kleine Nickerchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Wee warriors! I don't know if I like them."
msgstr "Winzige Krieger! Ich weiß nicht, ob ich sie mag."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "Easy now!"
msgstr "Ruhig jetzt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "The hive is silent."
msgstr "Der Bienenkorb ist ruhig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "It's a honey treasure trove!"
msgstr "Ein Honigschatz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "A sweet box of wee warriors."
msgstr "Ein niedliche Schachtel mit kleinen Kriegern."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "Where's the honey?"
msgstr "Wo ist der Honig?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "It's a honey treasure trove!"
msgstr "Ein Honigschatz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Pithy honey. More patience is needed."
msgstr "Nur wenig Honig. Man braucht mehr Geduld."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "The critter has finally learned its role."
msgstr "Das Wesen hat seine Rolle endlich verstanden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Come along beastie."
msgstr "Komm mit, Bestie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Ancient woolen beasts!"
msgstr "Uralte wollige Bestien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "Are you cold without your wools?"
msgstr "Ist dir kalt ohne deine Wolle?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "The noble steed of a mighty warrior!"
msgstr "Das edle Ross eines mächtigen Kriegers!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "My mouth's watering just looking at it..."
msgstr "Allein der Gedanke daran, macht mir den Mund wässrig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "With the stalwart beast at my side, we ride tonight!"
msgstr "Mit dem unerschütterlichen Tier an meiner Seite reiten wir heute abend!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sounds like Aunt Hilda."
msgstr "Hört sich an wie Tante Hilda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "That would suit me."
msgstr "Der würde mir stehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "I do love woolly things."
msgstr "Ich liebe wollige Dinge."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "En guarde!"
msgstr "En guarde!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "A bee helm, of course."
msgstr "Das ist natürlich ein Bienenhelm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "Always buzzing, always plotting."
msgstr "Sie summen und hecken immer neue Dinge aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "It sounds suspicious."
msgstr "Das klingt verdächtig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "Watch your step!"
msgstr "Pass auf, was du tust!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Your monarchy shall topple this day!"
msgstr "Heute wird deine Monarchie enden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "A land not of milk, but of honey."
msgstr "Ein Land zwar nicht von Milch, aber Honig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "The bees are expanding their domain."
msgstr "Die Bienen erweitern ihr Reich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "A hive of winged warriors."
msgstr "Ein ganzer Schwarm geflügelter Krieger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "The stuff of candlemakers."
msgstr "Daraus kann man Kerzen machen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR"
msgid "You shall be chained again, foe!"
msgstr "Du wirst wieder in Ketten liegen, Feind!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "I prefer the ringing resonance of clashing blades."
msgstr "Ich bevorzuge den Klang von aufeinandertreffenden Klingen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "What a brave beast!"
msgstr "Ein mutiger Bär."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG"
msgid "The beast hath been imbued with a fighting spirit!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "It has gone to Valhalla."
msgstr "Er ist jetzt in Walhalla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a stuffed beast."
msgstr "Ein gefüllter Bär."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "Fruits. I don't like 'em."
msgstr "Früchte. Mag ich nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "Warm red mush."
msgstr "Warmer, roter Brei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "I'd prefer a juicy steak."
msgstr "Ein saftiges Steak wär mir lieber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "You're not meat."
msgstr "Du bist nicht Fleisch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "Should we put some turds on it?"
msgstr "Sollten wir ein paar Scheisshaufen drauflegen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Consumed by passionate flame!"
msgstr "Von leidenschaftlichen Flammen verzehrt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "Disease festers within its soul."
msgstr "Seine Seele ist ganz krank."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "It is weakening before mine eyes!"
msgstr "Es wird vor meinen Augen schwächer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "A fruit bush."
msgstr "Ein Obststrauch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "The fruits have been snatched."
msgstr "Die Früchte hat sich jemand geschnappt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It's too hot to grow."
msgstr "Es ist zu heiß, um zu wachsen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Gut!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "Consumed by passionate flame!"
msgstr "Von leidenschaftlichen Flammen verzehrt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "Disease festers within its soul."
msgstr "Seine Seele ist ganz krank."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "It is weakening before mine eyes!"
msgstr "Es wird vor meinen Augen schwächer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "It's covered in rabbit food."
msgstr "Das ist voller Kaninchenfutter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "The rabbit food is all gone."
msgstr "Das Kaninchenfutter ist alle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "It looks atrocious."
msgstr "Sieht heruntergekommen aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "That's something completely different!"
msgstr "Ich möchte etwas anderes essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "A young tree warrior!"
msgstr "Ein junger Baumkrieger!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "You can feast in Valhalla now, friend."
msgstr "Jetzt lass es dir in Walhalla gutgehen, mein Freund."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "A home for my ravens!"
msgstr "Ein Haus für meine Raben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "What do you want, little friend?"
msgstr "Was willst du?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Are you having a nice time?"
msgstr "Hast du eine schöne Zeit?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "The cage is soiled."
msgstr "Der Käfig ist schmutzig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sweet dreams, raven friend."
msgstr "Süße Träume, Rabenfreund."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "The raven wishes to feast!"
msgstr "Der Rabe möchte essen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "I'm a cunning raven catcher!"
msgstr "Ich bin ein verschlagener Rabenfänger!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "Eggy."
msgstr "Ei-ig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "Hot egg."
msgstr "Heißes Ei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "This one needs a good smack."
msgstr "Der braucht wohl einen kleinen Klaps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Rrraugh!"
msgstr "Kawumm!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Be wary of his blasts!"
msgstr "Achte auf seine Stöße."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "Like the breath of a dragon."
msgstr "Wie der Atem eines Drachen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "Njord guide my blows!"
msgstr "Njord führt meine Schläge!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "Njord, lend me thy strength!"
msgstr "Njord, gib mir deine Kraft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "Projectile weaponry!"
msgstr "Projektilwaffe!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "Goodnight to our foes."
msgstr "Ein 'Gute Nacht' für meine Feinde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
msgid "A face-to-face fight would be more honorable."
msgstr "Ein persönlicher Kampf wäre ehrenhafter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET"
msgid "Cold jewelery."
msgstr "Kalter Schmuck."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM"
msgid "An icy blue sapphire."
msgstr "Ein eisig blauer Saphir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE"
msgid "Odin's eye!"
msgstr "Odins Auge!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON"
msgid "Oh, a map! No, wait. That's wrong."
msgstr "Oh, eine Landkarte! Nein, warte. Das stimmt nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "Tis a blessed scroll."
msgstr "Es ist eine heilige Schriftrolle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "Hmm, a blue one."
msgstr "Hmm, ein blauer Pilz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "I have no desire to eat it."
msgstr "Das will ich gar nicht essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's mold, really."
msgstr "Der ist schimmelig, wirklich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "Good, it's hiding."
msgstr "Gut, er versteckt sich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I hope it doesn't grow again."
msgstr "Ich hoffe, er wächst nicht wieder nach."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Grandfather logs."
msgstr "Großvater Holzblock."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "Tis barely a fight."
msgstr "Es ist kaum ein Kampf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "You shall be a worthy opponent!"
msgstr "Du sollst ein würdiger Gegner sein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOAT"
msgid "Is that how I got here?"
msgstr "Bin ich so hergekommen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Bits of our enemies."
msgstr "Stücke unserer Feinde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Delicious!"
msgstr "Köstlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "To rule the skies!"
msgstr "Um die Lüfte zu beherrschen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "This tome is brimming with Hel's fire!"
msgstr "Dieses Werk steckt voller Höllenfeuer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "Twas not meant for mortal eyes."
msgstr "Das war nicht für sterbliche Augen gedacht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "The curse of Alviss dwells within."
msgstr "Der Fluch von Alviss wohnt darin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "But can it tend the garden of mine soul?"
msgstr "Aber kann es auf den Garten meiner Seele pflegen?"

