msgid "I wonder if the rest burnt down."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, ob der Rest abgebrannt ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "What sort of bush doesn't burn?!"
msgstr "Was für ein Busch brennt nicht?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "The worst kind of tree. The non-flammable kind."
msgstr "Die schlechteste Art des Baums. Die nicht entzündbare Art."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Burn, thorns!"
msgstr "Brennt, ihr Dornen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks sharp."
msgstr "Das sieht scharf aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Those thorns hurt!"
msgstr "Die Dornen tun weh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "It's all plant-y."
msgstr "Pflanze."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "JA! BRENNE!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, er würde immer noch brennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Not so spiky now, are you?"
msgstr "Jetzt bist du nicht mehr so stachlig, was?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks dangerous!"
msgstr "Sieht gefährlich aus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "He's so condescending."
msgstr "Er ist so herablassend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "He sure likes to talk."
msgstr "Er mag es zu sprechen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "These are no fun. They light themselves."
msgstr "Dies macht keinen Spaß. Die zünden sich selbst an."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "It just needs a key."
msgstr "Da fehlt jetzt einfach ein Schlüssel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "I like more exciting music."
msgstr "Ich mag nur spannendere Musik."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "Looks sticky."
msgstr "Sieht klebrig aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "This could be made better with FIRE!"
msgstr "Mit FEUER könnte ich es aufwerten!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "Meat made into spheres and improved with fire."
msgstr "Kugeln aus Fleisch, die im Feuer nochmals verbessert wurden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "Maybe the fire wasn't the best drying method..."
msgstr "Vielleicht war das Feuer nicht die beste Trocknungsmethode..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "It's ready!"
msgstr "Es ist fertig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "Come on meat, dry already!"
msgstr "Los, Fleisch, trockne endlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Forget the rain! Dry!"
msgstr "Vergiss den Regen! Trockne!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "I want to hang some meat!"
msgstr "Ich will etwas Fleisch aufhängen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Chewy, but satisfying."
msgstr "Schwer zu kauen, aber zufriedenstellend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "Eww, it's all swampy."
msgstr "Ihh, er ist total sumpfig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Double whammy!"
msgstr "Doppelt gut!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's what you get for being so stinky!"
msgstr "Das ist dafür, weil du so stinkst!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "It's true, no one cares."
msgstr "Es ist wahr, es interessiert niemanden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "No one would care if this burned down."
msgstr "Es würde niemanden interessieren, wenn es abbrennen würde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "It's not real fire, but it's still pretty fun."
msgstr "Das ist zwar kein echtes Feuer, aber es ist trotzdem ganz witzig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "No fun, making me exercise to stay cool!"
msgstr "Kein Spaß. Da muss man sich anstrengen, um kühl zu bleiben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Haha oh man, who drew THAT?"
msgstr "Haha, oh Mann, wer hat denn DAS gezeichnet?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "Looks kinda bare."
msgstr "Sieht ein bisschen kahl aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "It's like a sign, but smaller."
msgstr "Es ist wie ein Zeichen, aber kleiner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Poor thing. Trapped in this maze."
msgstr "Armes Ding. Gefangen in diesem Irrgarten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "I want big horns like that!"
msgstr "Ich will auch so große Hörner haben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "I wonder if the rings are an indication of age."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, ob die Ringe ein Anzeichen des Alters darstellen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "Coming up for a peek!"
msgstr "Komm doch für einen kurzen Blick nach oben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Out of the ground, into the fire."
msgstr "Aus dem Boden, in das Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Hiding from the light, huh?"
msgstr "Versteckt sich vor dem Licht, was?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "I'm not sure about this..."
msgstr "Ich bin mir dabei nicht sicher..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "It burrows away from the sun's skyfire. Unnatural."
msgstr "Weit unten, weg von der Sonne. Das ist unnatürlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Joke's on you! I can burn this poo."
msgstr "Der Witz ist auf deiner Seite! Ich kann deine Kacke verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "What a wonderfully flammable home."
msgstr "Was für ein wunderbar entflammbares Haus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "Noodles, meat and clumps of hair. Nasty."
msgstr "Nudeln, Fleisch und Haarklumpen. Ekelhaft."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Gross. It's full of hairs."
msgstr "Widerlich. Voller Haare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "It's dry and smells strange."
msgstr "Es ist trocken und riecht seltsam."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "Oh look, a bunch of smashed up rocks!"
msgstr "Oh schau, ein paar zerschlagene Felsen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's expecting something from me."
msgstr "Es erwartet etwas von mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "Ughh! It's doing the exact opposite of burning!"
msgstr "Oh Mann! Es ist das genaue Gegenteil von verbrennen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Hurry up already, stupid rock!"
msgstr "Beeil dich doch, dummer Stein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "That's obviously completely wrong."
msgstr "Das ist natürlich völlig falsch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "Doesn't work down here."
msgstr "Hier unten funktioniert das nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "What the heck? I can still see the moon!"
msgstr "Sowas, ich seh immer noch den Mond!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "That's as full as it gets."
msgstr "Voller geht's nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "A new moon! Great, I hated the old one!"
msgstr "Neumond! Prima, der alte hat mir nicht mehr gefallen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon's outta here!"
msgstr "Der Mond ist da draußen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon is waxing, unlike me."
msgstr "Der Mond nimmt ab, ganz im Gegensatz zu mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "Great. A rock with a hole in it."
msgstr "Wunderbar. Ein Stein mit einem Loch drin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "Looks like a jerk."
msgstr "Sieht idiotisch aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "Just another rock to me."
msgstr "Nur eine weitere langweilige Pflanze."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "Well I can't burn it."
msgstr "Na, das kann ich nicht verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "Oh look! ROCKS! Ughhhhh!"
msgstr "Oh, schau! STEINE! Oh Mann!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "What in the world..."
msgstr "Was zur..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "It's huuuuge!"
msgstr "Es ist riiiiiiiesig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "Ugh, it smells like bird butts!"
msgstr "Es riecht wie das Ende eines Vogels."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "So annoying!"
msgstr "So nervig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "Keep that mouth away from me!"
msgstr "Halt deinen Mund von mir fern!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Blood must bubble in currents muggy and thick."
msgstr "Das Blut blubbert und strömt feuchtwarm und dickflüssig hindurch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Its feathers are frazzled."
msgstr "Seine Federn sind zerfetzt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Better it than me."
msgstr "Besser er als ich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "It's full of dead stuff, I bet."
msgstr "Ich wette, er ist voll mit totem Zeug."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "The vines coil away from my lighter... weird!"
msgstr "Die Reben wenden sich von meinem Feuerzeug ab... komisch!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "It's made of some kind of jerk rock I can't burn."
msgstr "Das ist aus einem Gestein, das ich nicht verbrennen kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's so useful!"
msgstr "Die ist echt hilfreich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "She's gonna blow!"
msgstr "Die fliegt gleich in die Luft!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "I don't like having my head messed with."
msgstr "Ich mag es nicht, wenn man mich so durcheinander macht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "How could that not work?!"
msgstr "Wie konnte das nicht funktionieren?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A big gross mushroom! Burn it!"
msgstr "Ein großer grässlicher Pilz! Verbrenn ihn!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "Mold problem's taken care of."
msgstr "Das Problem mit der Feuchtigkeit hat sich erledigt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It's just a dumb log."
msgstr "Es ist nur ein dummes Stück Holz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "Gross, they're taking over!"
msgstr "Schrecklich, die übernehmen alles!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "Nasty. Let's burn the rot out."
msgstr "Auweh. Lass uns die Fäulnis ausbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "I'm sure fire would fix that."
msgstr "Ich bin sicher, dass das mit Feuer zu beheben wäre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "There's mushrooms growing in it now."
msgstr "Da wachsen jetzt Pilze drin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Geez, who even needs that many mushrooms?"
msgstr "Meine Güte, wer braucht so viele Pilze?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "C'mon, you saw that coming."
msgstr "Komm schon, das hast du doch kommen sehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "This dumb mushroom's not lighting up."
msgstr "Der blöde Pilz brennt nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Not as nice as a warm fire."
msgstr "Nicht so schön wie ein warmes Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr "Und jetzt?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "I've got a few ideas on how to light it. Heh heh."
msgstr "Ich habe ein paar Ideen, wie man es anzünden kann. Hehe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "Pfft, well that was a bright idea."
msgstr "Pfft, das war eine super Idee."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "It's spreading junk everywhere."
msgstr "Überall dieser Mist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Gross. It smells like leprechaun butt."
msgstr "Widerlich! Das riecht wie das Hinterteil eines Kobolds."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Ew, I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "Ew, ich will nicht zu nahe zu kommen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Gross. It's all mushroomy."
msgstr "Widerlich! Das ist vollkommen pilzig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Ack! It stinks!"
msgstr "Iiih. Das stinkt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Gross. This tree is sick all over."
msgstr "Widerlich! Dieser Baum ist vollkommen krank."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED"
msgid "That one got what it deserves."
msgstr "Was ist los? Fehlt Erde?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "It's like fire, but purple!"
msgstr "Das ist wie Feuer, nur lila!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "Eww, it's still warm!"
msgstr "Ihh, es ist noch warm!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "Light without fire is unnatural."
msgstr "Licht ohne Feuer. Wie unnatürlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "Looks normal to me."
msgstr "Wirkt auf mich ganz normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "I guess it's nearly over."
msgstr "Ich schätze, dass es fast vorbei ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "I don't think it's working."
msgstr "Ich glaube nicht, dass das funktioniert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "It's almost humming."
msgstr "Sie summt fast schon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "I think it's turning off."
msgstr "Ich glaube, es ist ausgeschaltet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "It's warning me."
msgstr "Es warnt mich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "The fuel is coming to life!"
msgstr "Der Treibstoff erwacht zum Leben!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "It'd be way cooler if it was on fire..."
msgstr "Es wäre selbst dann kühler, wenn es in Flammen stehen würde..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "It's like dreams that can hurt real things!"
msgstr "Wie Träume, die sich auf echte Dinge auswirken können."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "There are tiny explosions trapped inside."
msgstr "Darin sind winzige Explosionen gefangen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE"
msgid "It's a bunch of water."
msgstr "Lauter Wasser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I can do the pyrotechnics too!"
msgstr "Ich kann die Pyrotechnik auch machen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "It's glittery and mesmerizing, like a fire!"
msgstr "Es ist glitzernd und faszinierend wie ein Feuer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Gotta hold it with my sleeve so my hands don't get cold."
msgstr "Muss es mit meinem Ärmel anfassen, damit meine Hände nicht kalt werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "It picks up burning materials!"
msgstr "Es spürt Brennmaterial auf."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It'll make your fingers tingle."
msgstr "Es lässt deine Finger kribbeln."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's a rock. Ugh!"
msgstr "Es ist ein Stein. Oh Mann!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "It gives me a headache."
msgstr "Das macht mir Kopfschmerzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Kind of tacky."
msgstr "Irgendwie klebrig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Music is boring."
msgstr "Musik ist langweilig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I bet it'd burn!"
msgstr "Ich wette, dass es brennt!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "It's got a weaponized butt!"
msgstr "Es hat einen waffenfähigen Hintern!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Run away, tiny dancers."
msgstr "Verschwindet, ihr kleinen Tänzer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Evil bird! Get away from those yummy berries!"
msgstr "Böser Vogel! Verschwinde von meinen leckeren Beeren!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's a big ol' fan."
msgstr "Es ist ein großer alter Ventilator."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that's burned now."
msgstr "Das ist jetzt verbrannt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do we have to do now?"
msgstr "Was müssen wir jetzt tun?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't even like gobblers!"
msgstr "Dabei mag ich Truthähne nicht einmal!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "Tasty things, sealed with fire."
msgstr "Schmackhafte Dinger, im Feuer zubereitet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Stupid flowers. They're almost useless."
msgstr "Blöde Blumen. Zu fast nichts zu gebrauchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Ew, they're sticky."
msgstr "Ihh, die kleben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "How am I supposed to burn it now?"
msgstr "Wie soll ich es jetzt verbrennen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "Gross! Let's burn it."
msgstr "Widerlich! Sollten wir verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "It's very pointy."
msgstr "Die ist sehr spitz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "Völlig am Ende."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "Dich mag ich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Eat dirt!"
msgstr "Friss Dreck!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "Der scheint diese Symbole echt zu mögen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I like his attitude!"
msgstr "Ich mag seine Einstellung."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "It's a backpack made out of butts!"
msgstr "Ein Rucksack aus Hinterteilen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It can always get worse, I guess."
msgstr "Ich schätze, es kann immer schlechter werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess I have it alright."
msgstr "Ich schätze, ich habe alles richtig gemacht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Nice redecorating job!"
msgstr "Nette Renovierungsaufgabe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "He's doing pig things in there."
msgstr "Er macht da drin Schweinereien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These pigs have questionable taste in architecture."
msgstr "Diese Schweine haben einen zweifelhaften Architekturgeschmack."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "You jerk! Let me in!"
msgstr "Du Idiot! Lass mich rein!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Blech. What a slob."
msgstr "Igitt! Was für ein Chaot."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder how they taste."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, wie sie schmecken würden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Ick. It's following me."
msgstr "Ihh. Es verfolgt mich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh. They're fragrant."
msgstr "Igitt! Die riechen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "He's not the boss of me!"
msgstr "Er ist nicht mein Boss!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Bring it on, piggie!"
msgstr "Versuch's doch, Schweinchen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt. I like it."
msgstr "Verbrannt. Gefällt mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs meat."
msgstr "Braucht Fleisch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Where's the shrine to me?"
msgstr "Wo ist der Schrein für mich?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Ha ha. A pig's butt."
msgstr "Haha. Das Hinterteil eines Schweins."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "It smells terrible!"
msgstr "Pfui, das riecht schrecklich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "These pigs sure know how to have a good time."
msgstr "Die Schweine scheinen zu wissen, wie man sich gut fühlt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "I'd burn it, but it might be worth something."
msgstr "Ich würde es verbrennen, aber es könnte etwas wert sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "Hey there, tree seed."
msgstr "Na, du kleiner Baumsamen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "Bald wirst du ein richtiger Baum sein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Three times the pointiness."
msgstr "Dreimal spitz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "Eww, it's all slimy."
msgstr "Ihh, das ist total schleimig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Fire makes everything better."
msgstr "Feuer macht alles besser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd eat it if I had to."
msgstr "Wenn ich müsste, würde ich's essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Hurry up, you stupid plant!"
msgstr "Beeil dich, du dumme Pflanze!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Oh boy. Vegetables."
msgstr "Oh, man. Gemüse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's crackly and dry. Good kindling!"
msgstr "Sie ist knisternd und trocken. Gutes Anzündholz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Why, %s... that fire in your eyes!"
msgstr "Mensch, %s! Dieses Feuer in deinen Augen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "BUUURN!"
msgstr "BRENNE!!!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "Hallo, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "I better get a heart for %s."
msgstr "Ich brauche ein Herz für %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Burn the murderer!"
msgstr "Verbrennt den Mörder!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "Who do ghosts call? %s!"
msgstr "Wen rufen denn Geister an? %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Is it supposed to have this many parts?"
msgstr "Hat das immer so viele Teile?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Fire always makes things better."
msgstr "Mit Feuer wird alles besser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like the part from inside the fruit."
msgstr "Ein winziger Samen. Sieht aus wie die Teile im Inneren der Frucht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "This pond will definitely not ignite. How dull."
msgstr "Dieser Teich lässt sich sicher nicht entzünden. Wie dumm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "It must need a lot of water."
msgstr "Es braucht viel Wasser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Ew. Nasty. But useful."
msgstr "Ihh. Ekelhaft. Aber nützlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "I'd rather burn them."
msgstr "Ich würde sie lieber verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I wonder if it is flammable."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, ob das brennbar ist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I wonder what would happen if I applied fire."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, was geschieht, wenn ich ihn mit Feuer kombiniere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Cookies!!!"
msgstr "Kekse!!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Fire on the outside turned out pretty well."
msgstr "Die äußere Einwirkung von Feuer hat sich als ziemlich gut erwiesen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Fire on the inside is amazing!"
msgstr "Das Feuer im Inneren ist beeindruckend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Seeds for fire's best vegetable-friend... the pumpkin."
msgstr "Samen für den besten Gemüsefreund des Feuers: den Kürbis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "Has science gone too far?"
msgstr "Ist die Wissenschaft zu weit gegangen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Weird!"
msgstr "Unheimlich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "Some sort of weird rock."
msgstr "Irgendein komisches Gestein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "I wonder where all the food goes. Probably somewhere gross."
msgstr "Ich frage mich, wohin das ganze Essen geht. Bestimmt etwas ekliges."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't. Look. Up."
msgstr "Nur nicht hochschauen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "Boring."
msgstr "Langweilig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Yawn."
msgstr "Gähn."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "What's so great about her?"
msgstr "Was ist so toll an ihr?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "Haha! Look at this dumb goat statue."
msgstr "Haha! Sieh dir diese dumme Ziegenstatue an."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Ew. It's ugly."
msgstr "Igitt. Wie hässlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Haha. You're old."
msgstr "Haha. Du bist alt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "But I want more berries!"
msgstr "Ich will mehr Beeren!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "Now I don't have to use my hands."
msgstr "Jetzt muss ich meine Hände nicht mehr benutzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "Es ist nur ein Haufen Samen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "Fancy."
msgstr "Schick."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "It's kinda small."
msgstr "Es ist ziemlich klein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "Wow. A coin. Pfft."
msgstr "Wow. Eine Münze. Na toll."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "I can probably buy something good with this."
msgstr "Ich kann wahrscheinlich etwas Gutes damit kaufen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "I'm rich!"
msgstr "Ich bin reich!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "Guess that thing liked what we gave it."
msgstr "Ich schätze, das Ding mochte, was wir ihm gegeben haben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "Needs more fire."
msgstr "Braucht mehr Feuer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "I bet it's tasty."
msgstr "Ich wette, es ist lecker."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "That'll show those crabs."
msgstr "Das wird es diesen Krebsen zeigen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "I can take my pick of them."
msgstr "Ich kann sie mir aussuchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "Can you just eat flour?"
msgstr "Kann man Mehl einfach essen?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "Leaf this to a professional."
msgstr "Jetzt kochen die Profis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe that thing up there'll eat it."
msgstr "Vielleicht frisst es das Ding da oben."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "This should shut that thing up for a while."
msgstr "Das sollte das Ding für eine Weile zum Schweigen bringen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "This won't shut it up for long."
msgstr "Das wird es nicht lange zum Schweigen bringen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "It doesn't want that. Might as well burn it."
msgstr "Das will es nicht. Wir können es genauso gut verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "Looks good to me."
msgstr "Sieht gut aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "It's just a couple cloves of garlic."
msgstr "Es sind nur ein paar Knoblauchzehen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Fire made it better."
msgstr "Feuer machte es besser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "Es ist nur ein Haufen Samen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID"
msgid "He'll eat just about anything."
msgstr "Er frisst fast alles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
msgid "What? We needed milk."
msgstr "Was? Wir brauchten Milch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM"
msgid "Her eyes creep me out."
msgstr "Ihre Augen machen mir Angst."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL"
msgid "Fire it up!"
msgstr "Und anzünden!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM"
msgid "Ugh, I guess I should set it up."
msgstr "Auweh, ich schätze, ich sollte ihn aufstellen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL"
msgid "If it was bigger I could use more fire."
msgstr "Wenn es größer wäre, könnte ich mehr Feuer gebrauchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM"
msgid "I should set it up over the firepit."
msgstr "Ich sollte ihn über der Feuerstellen aufbauen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE"
msgid "You mean I gotta do work?"
msgstr "Du meinst, ich muss arbeiten?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY"
msgid "I'll use this if I can't burn it open."
msgstr "Ich benutze das, wenn ich es nicht aufbrennen kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK"
msgid "There's more stuff to burn in the park."
msgstr "Es gibt noch mehr Zeug im Park zu verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST"
msgid "Just an old lamp post."
msgstr "Nur ein alter Laternenpfahl."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT"
msgid "Whatever. It's a lamp."
msgstr "Egal. Es ist eine Lampe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
msgid "I can smash stuff down with it."
msgstr "Ich kann damit Sachen zerstören."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "That's what passes for a village around here, I guess."
msgstr "Sowas geht hier in der Gegend wohl als Dorf durch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "There's a lot of stuff to burn in there."
msgstr "Da ist eine Menge Zeug drin, das man verbrennen kann."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "I'd burn it, but I need the things in there."
msgstr "Ich würde es verbrennen, aber ich brauche die Sachen da drin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "It's totally raw. Fire could fix that!"
msgstr "Es ist total roh. Feuer könnte da helfen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
msgid "They're so hideous they're almost cute."
msgstr "Sie sind so hässlich, dass sie fast niedlich sind."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
msgid "Hey! Give me more mushrooms!"
msgstr "Hey! Gib mir mehr Pilze!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
msgid "It's so bulbous."
msgstr "Es ist so bauchig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Roasting. My favorite cooking method."
msgstr "Braten. Meine Lieblingskochmethode."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "Es ist nur ein Haufen Samen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN"
msgid "Now we're cooking."
msgstr "Jetzt geht's los!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM"
msgid "I can't wait to use it!"
msgstr "Ich kann es kaum erwarten, es zu benutzen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE"
msgid "That looks sharp."
msgstr "Das sieht scharf aus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "Widerlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2"
msgid "Ugly."
msgstr "Hässlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN"
msgid "A fountain with no water. Maybe that's a metaphor?"
msgstr "Ein Brunnen ohne Wasser. Vielleicht ist das eine Metapher?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC"
msgid "Didn't even have to melt the locks."
msgstr "Ich musste nicht einmal die Schlösser schmelzen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED"
msgid "I can't even burn it open!"
msgstr "Ich kann es nicht mal aufbrennen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
msgid "It's stone. I can't burn it."
msgstr "Es ist aus Stein. Ich kann es nicht verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
msgid "Cremation is the only way to do it."
msgstr "Einäscherung ist der einzige Weg, es zu tun."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB"
msgid "Don't worry, I won't kick you."
msgstr "Keine Sorge, ich werde dich nicht treten."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Sie ist tot."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC"
msgid "I haven't got any crumbs for you."
msgstr "Ich habe keine Krümel für dich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's taking a nap."
msgstr "Er macht ein Nickerchen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
msgid "Ohh. Look who's fancy now!"
msgstr "Ohh. Wie vornehm!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "Blech! Tastes like ocean."
msgstr "Igitt! Schmeckt nach Meer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL"
msgid "I'm just gonna keep jumping through portals til I figure out a way home."
msgstr "Ich werde einfach weiter durch Portale springen, bis ich einen Weg nach Hause gefunden habe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY"
msgid "Fancy key."
msgstr "Eleganter Schlüssel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT"
msgid "I should light a fire under its butt."
msgstr "Ich sollte ein Feuer unter seinem Hintern anzünden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO"
msgid "We grew it in that gross muck."
msgstr "Wir haben es in diesem ekligen Dreck wachsen lassen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking just means sticking stuff in fire."
msgstr "Kochen bedeutet nur, Sachen in Feuer zu stecken."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "Es ist nur ein Haufen Samen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER"
msgid "I set it up. Now what?"
msgstr "Ich habe es arrangiert. Was jetzt?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM"
msgid "It needs to be set up in a firepit."
msgstr "Es muss in einer Feuerstelle aufgestellt werden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL"
msgid "It goes with the fire."
msgstr "Es passt zum Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP"
msgid "Sweet stuff goes in there."
msgstr "Süßes Zeug kommt da rein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP"
msgid "That one stayed in the ground too long."
msgstr "Das hier blieb zu lange im Boden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE"
msgid "Metal doesn't burn well."
msgstr "Metall brennt nicht gut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE"
msgid "It's so busted, I don't even wanna light it on fire."
msgstr "Es ist so kaputt, dass ich es nicht mal anzünden will."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL"
msgid "What a waste. It could've burned down."
msgstr "Was für eine Verschwendung. Es hätte abbrennen können."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY"
msgid "What's a chimney without a fireplace?"
msgstr "Was ist ein Schornstein ohne Kamin?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2"
msgid "Ugh! It won't even burn."
msgstr "Ugh! Es wird nicht mal brennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK"
msgid "I'd love to burn that to ashes."
msgstr "Ich würde das gerne zu Asche verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER"
msgid "That would look better on fire."
msgstr "Das würde besser aussehen, wenn es brennt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1"
msgid "It's like there was a Great Fire, without the fire."
msgstr "Es ist, als hätte es ein großes Feuer gegeben, ohne das Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2"
msgid "There's no one here. Boring."
msgstr "Hier ist niemand. Langweilig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3"
msgid "I wish this would burn."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, das würde brennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR"
msgid "It'd be better if it was burnt."
msgstr "Es wäre besser, wenn es verbrannt wäre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF"
msgid "The roof isn't on fire."
msgstr "Das Dach brennt nicht."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ha! Cracked it."
msgstr "Ha! Hab's geknackt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED"
msgid "I can't get it to open."
msgstr "Ich kann es nicht öffnen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON"
msgid "Look at it, flopping around like that."
msgstr "Sieh es dir an, wie es herumflattert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED"
msgid "All it needed was some fire."
msgstr "Alles, was es brauchte, war etwas Feuer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT"
msgid "I need a pinch or two on all my food."
msgstr "Ich brauche eine Prise oder zwei auf mein ganzes Essen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK"
msgid "I licked one. Had to."
msgstr "Ich habe einen geleckt. Ich musste es tun."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Grow faster, salt crystals!"
msgstr "Wachst schneller, Salzkristalle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY"
msgid "Gotta dredge the salt up."
msgstr "Ich muss das Salz ausbaggern."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM"
msgid "We can use it to get some cooking salt."
msgstr "Wir können es benutzen, um etwas Kochsalz zu bekommen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP"
msgid "Mmm! Pure sugar!"
msgstr "Mmm! Reiner Zucker!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET"
msgid "Now we can get sap out of the trees."
msgstr "Jetzt können wir Saft aus den Bäumen holen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING"
msgid "Well. Might as well burn it now."
msgstr "Naja. Wir können es auch gleich verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED"
msgid "Well that's dumb."
msgstr "Nun, das ist dumm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Aw...I won't know what these are until I plant them."
msgstr "Ach... ich werde nicht wissen, was das ist, bis ich sie gepflanzt habe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL"
msgid "I'd rather burn things."
msgstr "Ich würde lieber Dinge verbrennen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND"
